[{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/edit2509_top.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/edit2509_top.jpg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://qwen.ai","label":"QWEN CHAT","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://qwen.ai\" label=\"QWEN CHAT\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen-Image","label":"GITHUB","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen-Image\" label=\"GITHUB\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509","label":"HUGGING FACE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509\" label=\"HUGGING FACE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509","label":"MODELSCOPE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509\" label=\"MODELSCOPE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4","label":"DISCORD","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4\" label=\"DISCORD\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"This September, we are pleased to introduce Qwen-Image-Edit-2509, the monthly iteration of Qwen-Image-Edit. To experience the latest model, please visit [Qwen Chat](https://qwen.ai)  and select the \"Image Editing\" feature.","text":"This September, we are pleased to introduce Qwen-Image-Edit-2509, the monthly iteration of Qwen-Image-Edit. To experience the latest model, please visit [Qwen Chat](https://qwen.ai)  and select the \"Image Editing\" feature.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"This September, we are pleased to introduce Qwen-Image-Edit-2509, the monthly iteration of Qwen-Image-Edit. To experience the latest model, please visit ","text":"This September, we are pleased to introduce Qwen-Image-Edit-2509, the monthly iteration of Qwen-Image-Edit. To experience the latest model, please visit ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[Qwen Chat](https://qwen.ai)","href":"https://qwen.ai","title":null,"text":"Qwen Chat","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen Chat","text":"Qwen Chat","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":"  and select the \"Image Editing\" feature.","text":"  and select the \"Image Editing\" feature.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Compared with Qwen-Image-Edit released in August, the main improvements of Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 include:","text":"Compared with Qwen-Image-Edit released in August, the main improvements of Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 include:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Compared with Qwen-Image-Edit released in August, the main improvements of Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 include:","text":"Compared with Qwen-Image-Edit released in August, the main improvements of Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 include:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li><p><strong>Multi-image Editing Support</strong>: For multi-image inputs, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 builds upon the Qwen-Image-Edit architecture and is further trained via image concatenation to enable multi-image editing. It supports various combinations such as “person + person,” “person + product,” and “person + scene.” </p></li><li><p><strong>Enhanced Single-image Consistency</strong>: For single-image inputs, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 significantly improves consistency, specifically in the following areas:</p><ul><li><strong>Improved Person Editing Consistency</strong>: Better preservation of facial identity, supporting various portrait styles and pose transformations;</li><li><strong>Improved Product Editing Consistency</strong>: Better preservation of product identity, supporting product poster editing；</li><li><strong>Improved Text Editing Consistency</strong>: In addition to modifying text content, it also supports editing text fonts, colors, and materials；</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Native Support for ControlNet</strong>: Including depth maps, edge maps, keypoint maps, and more.</p></li></ul>\n\n\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li><p><strong>Multi-image Editing Support</strong>: For multi-image inputs, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 builds upon the Qwen-Image-Edit architecture and is further trained via image concatenation to enable multi-image editing. It supports various combinations such as “person + person,” “person + product,” and “person + scene.” </p></li><li><p><strong>Enhanced Single-image Consistency</strong>: For single-image inputs, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 significantly improves consistency, specifically in the following areas:</p><ul><li><strong>Improved Person Editing Consistency</strong>: Better preservation of facial identity, supporting various portrait styles and pose transformations;</li><li><strong>Improved Product Editing Consistency</strong>: Better preservation of product identity, supporting product poster editing；</li><li><strong>Improved Text Editing Consistency</strong>: In addition to modifying text content, it also supports editing text fonts, colors, and materials；</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Native Support for ControlNet</strong>: Including depth maps, edge maps, keypoint maps, and more.</p></li></ul>\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Example Showcase\n","depth":2,"text":"Example Showcase","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Example Showcase","text":"Example Showcase","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**The primary update in Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 is support for multi-image inputs.**","text":"**The primary update in Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 is support for multi-image inputs.**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**The primary update in Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 is support for multi-image inputs.**","text":"The primary update in Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 is support for multi-image inputs.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"The primary update in Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 is support for multi-image inputs.","text":"The primary update in Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 is support for multi-image inputs.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Let’s first look at a \"person + person\" example:","text":"Let’s first look at a \"person + person\" example:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Let’s first look at a \"person + person\" example:","text":"Let’s first look at a \"person + person\" example:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片19.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片19.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Here is a \"person + scene\" example:","text":"Here is a \"person + scene\" example:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Here is a \"person + scene\" example:","text":"Here is a \"person + scene\" example:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片20.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片20.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Below is a \"person + object\" example:","text":"Below is a \"person + object\" example:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Below is a \"person + object\" example:","text":"Below is a \"person + object\" example:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片21.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片21.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"In fact, multi-image input also supports commonly used ControlNet keypoint maps—for example, changing a person’s pose:","text":"In fact, multi-image input also supports commonly used ControlNet keypoint maps—for example, changing a person’s pose:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"In fact, multi-image input also supports commonly used ControlNet keypoint maps—for example, changing a person’s pose:","text":"In fact, multi-image input also supports commonly used ControlNet keypoint maps—for example, changing a person’s pose:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片22.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片22.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Similarly, the following examples demonstrate results using three input images:","text":"Similarly, the following examples demonstrate results using three input images:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Similarly, the following examples demonstrate results using three input images:","text":"Similarly, the following examples demonstrate results using three input images:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name"