person consistency, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 shows significant improvement over Qwen-Image-Edit. Below are examples generating various portrait styles:","text":"First, regarding person consistency, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 shows significant improvement over Qwen-Image-Edit. Below are examples generating various portrait styles:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片1.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片1.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"For instance, changing a person’s pose while maintaining excellent identity consistency:","text":"For instance, changing a person’s pose while maintaining excellent identity consistency:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"For instance, changing a person’s pose while maintaining excellent identity consistency:","text":"For instance, changing a person’s pose while maintaining excellent identity consistency:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片2.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片2.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Leveraging this improvement along with Qwen-Image’s unique text rendering capability, we find that Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 excels at creating meme images:","text":"Leveraging this improvement along with Qwen-Image’s unique text rendering capability, we find that Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 excels at creating meme images:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Leveraging this improvement along with Qwen-Image’s unique text rendering capability, we find that Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 excels at creating meme images:","text":"Leveraging this improvement along with Qwen-Image’s unique text rendering capability, we find that Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 excels at creating meme images:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片3.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片3.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Of course, even with longer text, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 can still render it while preserving the person’s identity:","text":"Of course, even with longer text, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 can still render it while preserving the person’s identity:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Of course, even with longer text, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 can still render it while preserving the person’s identity:","text":"Of course, even with longer text, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 can still render it while preserving the person’s identity:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片4.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片4.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Person consistency is also evident in old photo restoration. Below are two examples:","text":"Person consistency is also evident in old photo restoration. Below are two examples:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Person consistency is also evident in old photo restoration. Below are two examples:","text":"Person consistency is also evident in old photo restoration. Below are two examples:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure"