onsistency. We find that the model can naturally generate product posters from plain-background product images:","text":"Second, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 specifically enhances product consistency. We find that the model can naturally generate product posters from plain-background product images:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片5.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片5.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Or even simple logos:","text":"Or even simple logos:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Or even simple logos:","text":"Or even simple logos:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片16.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片16.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Third, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 specifically enhances text consistency and supports editing font type, font color, and font material:","text":"Third, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 specifically enhances text consistency and supports editing font type, font color, and font material:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Third, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 specifically enhances text consistency and supports editing font type, font color, and font material:","text":"Third, Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 specifically enhances text consistency and supports editing font type, font color, and font material:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片10.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片10.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片11.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片11.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片12.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片12.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Moreover, the ability for precise text editing has been significantly enhanced:","text":"Moreover, the ability for precise text editing has been significantly enhanced:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Moreover, the ability for precise text editing has been significantly enhanced:","text":"Moreover, the ability for precise text editing has been significantly enhanced:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片13.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片13.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片14.JPG#center ","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/幻灯片14.JPG#center \" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"